    "Template Errors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板错误"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Templates": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模板"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PC version does this for you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑版会替你完成这一步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The PC version's Mobile Helper is the easiest route. The two cards below are fallbacks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电脑版的 Mobile Helper 是最省事的途径。下面的两张卡片是备选方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Status Bar reset is the one file here that is written whole, not nulled: a fresh, all-default %@ It goes through the same mechanism the Status Bar page applies with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里唯一被整体写入（而不是清零）的文件是状态栏重置文件：一个全新的、全部采用默认值的 %@。它使用的机制与状态栏页面应用时相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The choices you do not pick are deleted before the files are delivered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你没有选择的选项会在文件交付前被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen files are renamed to: %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选文件会被重命名为：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device's AFC service published nothing here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备的 AFC 服务没有在此处发布任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device's existing cloud configuration is not merged in (reading it needs a lockdown service this port has no path for), and no keybag certificate is generated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设备现有的云配置不会被合并进来（读取它需要一项 lockdown 服务，而本移植版没有相应的途径），也不会生成 keybag 证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The live-photo method writes the video into a Photos poster descriptor and needs a freeze frame — the reference raises rather than shipping a descriptor with no thumbnail. The video is rewrapped as .mov unless it already is one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实况照片方式会把视频写入 Photos 海报描述文件，并且需要一张定格帧——原版在缺少缩略图时会直接报错，而不是交付一个没有缩略图的描述文件。除非视频本身已经是 .mov，否则会被重新封装为 .mov。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The only template selected asks for sparserestore, which this app does not implement, so nothing is delivered from the Templates page and this run is not started for it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唯一选中的模板要求 sparserestore，而本 App 并未实现它，因此模板页面不会交付任何内容，本次运行也不会为它启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The switches below are live for the next run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下面的开关对下一次运行即时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This device is on iOS %@, which reads a legacy pack as it is, so nothing is converted here and no pack is asked about.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台设备运行的是 iOS %@，它会按原样读取旧版包，因此这里不会做任何转换，也不会询问任何包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature is hidden by HotLoad safety rules. See Settings for rule status.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此功能被 HotLoad 安全规则隐藏。请在设置中查看规则状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not all tweaks": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是全部调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This preset contains daemon modifications that were saved for a different device:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此预设包含为另一台设备保存的守护进程修改："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This toggle writes a value other than on/off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
